PARITY (web VehicleHero.tsx -> native, reproduced + tested)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  DATA      : web `Vehicle` / `VehicleState | null` + `firmwareVersion` + unit converters ->
              VehicleHeroPanelVehicle / VehicleHeroPanelState (SI: meters / m·s⁻¹ / °C; kW / hours /
              %); bound via the P1/S8 state-holder seam (VehicleHeroPanelSource); the view performs
              no networking.
  PROJECTION: web `state ? full-hero : asleep-panel` + the loading/error parent states ->
              VehicleHeroPanelProjection.resolve (phase loading / data / asleep / error). error >
              data(state present) > loading(isLoading) > asleep, reproduced + unit tested.
  GAUGES    : web `<RadialGauge>` block — battery (always, green>50 / amber<=50), range (always,
              cyan, max 600), speed (driving||speed>0, purple, max 250), power (charging, green,
              max 250), inside + outside (warm / blue, max 122°F or 50°C). Value+unit centre +
              clamped value/max fill. Native value+unit gauge built locally because the shared
              TSRadialGauge only renders a bare percent — verified gauge ids/value text/units/
              fractions per state.
  CHARGING  : web `is_charging` block — charge power (kW) / rate (dist/h) / time-to-full (h) + the
              "Done ~HH:MM" projected completion; pulsing bolt header (Reduce-Motion aware).
  STAT GRID : web `buildStatCards` — driving / charging / idle leading group + the four always-
              visible cards (status · sentry · firmware · power). Driving renders Power twice (web
              parity). Lock/Unlock + Sentry Active/Off are localized values; nil temp -> "—"; empty
              firmware -> "—"; power tone by sign (draw amber / regen green / idle grey). Exact card
              id order asserted per branch.
  ACTIONS   : web `<Link>` buttons — Details(/vehicles/{id}) · Commands · Live Map · Digital Twin ->
              VehicleHeroPanelAction -> onNavigate(VehicleHeroPanelRoute) seam; routes unit tested.
  ASLEEP    : web `state == null` -> this surface's empty state: skeleton + "Vehicle asleep — wake to
              see live data" + a Wake Up CTA routing to Commands; never a blank box.
  UNITS     : web useUnits converters reproduced SI->display (m->km/mi, m·s⁻¹->km·h⁻¹/mph, °C->°F);
              labels mi/km, mph/(km/h), °F/°C; power kW, time h, battery %. Golden values unit tested
              (e.g. 354 000 m -> "354" km / "220" mi; 20 °C -> "68" °F).
  COLOUR    : web per-item hex -> exact design tokens via VehicleHeroPanelPalette (ADR-006 semantic):
              battery #10b981->chartSeriesBattery, range #00f0ff->accent, speed #a855f7->
              chartSeriesPower, inside #f97316->chartSeriesEnergy, outside #3b82f6->chartSeriesSpeed,
              regen #10b981->statusSuccess, draw #f59e0b->statusWarning, idle #374151->textMuted,
              sentry #ef4444->statusDanger; status FSM variant -> tone.
  STATES    : loading skeleton · data (full hero) · asleep (empty CTA) · error+retry (QueryError
              equiv) · stale chip + 1-shot auto-refresh · offline chip + banner — every state renders;
              verified by per-state #Preview + projection / model tests.
  I18N      : all source `t()` keys + the common.* lock/sentry words + the vehicle.state.* badge
              labels + the native chrome live in the VehicleHero.strings table (P1/S10); no English
              literals in code — every string resolves through VehicleHeroPanelStrings facade.
  A11Y      : header / gauge / stat combined VoiceOver summaries (joiners unit tested), header trait,
              decorative icons hidden, Dynamic Type via Font.TS tokens, Reduce Motion on the gauge
              fill + charging pulse + skeleton shimmer.
  TELEMETRY : `view.opened surface=VehicleHero` emitted once on start (P1/S11), asserted by test.

